<p>
  Use the webhook URL above, including its user name and password, as the
  inbound webhook URL of your Postmark server. Inbound mail without these
  credentials is refused.
</p>
<%= button_to "Regenerate inbound password", gateway_path(gateway), method: :patch,
      params: { "gateway[regenerate_inbound_password]" => "1" },
      class: "btn btn-warning",
      form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Postmark will be refused until you update its inbound webhook URL. Continue?" } } %>
